    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d512">

                <pb facs="0574" n="558" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg558"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.85/9–1147: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Medellín, Colombia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Ragland</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Medellín</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-09-11">September 11,
                        1947</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>32. Angry anti-United States demonstration front Consulate between 6 and 6:45
                    last night. Crowd apparently led by students estimated 150 screamed such things
                    as “<hi rendition="#italic">abajo</hi> Truman and <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >viva</hi> La Flota Gran Colombiana”. Speeches referred to United States
                    imperialists and allegedly contained coarse language regarding United States and
                        <pb facs="0575" n="559" xml:id="pg559"/> President Truman. Of interest
                    crowds also shouted “<hi rendition="#italic">abajo los Liberates</hi>”.</p>
                <p>Police on hand and no damage done. Consulate building and residences Consular
                    officers under police guard which continues. Apparently no arrests and no
                    information yet available regarding mob leaders.</p>
                <p>While further trouble unlikely, am keeping official car under cover as
                    precaution. Incident unreported in local press. Embassy informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ragland</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
